moha700m/OpenShorts
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is a port of https://github.com/mutonby/openshorts (MIT,
Copyright (c) 2024 OpenShorts), with additions by moha700m (MIT):
access-token auth, runtime backend settings + Arabic font in the dashboard,
key-free heuristic moment picker, Arabic hook rendering, fake-IP DNS opt-in,
and the earlier lightweight implementation kept under lite/.

The upstream "cloud/" directory (OpenShorts Commercial License) is NOT
included here; billing / managed keys / hosted-service features are therefore
unavailable. Self-hosting the core app does not need it.

Bundled fonts: IBM Plex Sans Arabic (SIL OFL 1.1, fonts/IBMPlexSansArabic-OFL.txt).
